      "index": 0,
      "text": "Option A: Participate live during each live Zoom lecture. Join the live Zoom lecture. Use Poll Everywhere during the lecture to complete the participation assignment Note: You can get credit for participation once for each assignment. If you do the assignment in Poll Everywhere, you do not need to do the asynchronous assignment. A zero will appear in the Canvas grade book if you do not complete the Poll Everywhere assignment. It will be deleted when your asynchronous assignment is graded. Option B: Participate asynchronously by watching the recorded Lecture Videos (posted at the bottom of the Module 1 | Learning Materials page). After a video is posted, you can access the corresponding asynchronous participation assignment here: M1-0asy M1-00asy M1-1asy M1-2asy M1-3asy M1-4asy M1-5asy M1-6asy Feel free to switch back and forth between live participation and asynchronous participation as your schedule allows."
    },
