      "text": "Option 1: Take the quiz asynchronously. Quiz 1A_asy (Remotely Proctored) Quiz 1A_asy_work Quiz 1B_asy (Remotely Proctored) Quiz 1B_asy_work Option 2: Join a live Zoom session and take the quiz. Quiz 1A Quiz 1A_6pm Quiz 1B Quiz 1B_6pm"
